# Seasoned Cryomancer: with its enters ability on the stack, Bot1 bolts the Cryomancer. The ability resolves without its
# source (CR 113.7a): Bot1 still draws two and discards two, and the reflexive ability triggers from the gone source
# and taps and stuns both Ornithopters.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Island
Black Lotus
Seasoned Cryomancer
Lightning Bolt
Brainstorm
Island
Island
Force of Will
Dark Ritual
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Cryomancer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cryomancer)
Bot1.Choose(Brainstorm; Force of Will)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Force of Will; Brainstorm; Seasoned Cryomancer; Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Dark Ritual
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Counters.Stun = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Counters.Stun = 1
